<Base title="Contact | Sundays with Anna" description="How to get in touch with Anna from Sundays with Anna.">
<section class="p" style="padding-top:56px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto"><div class="up" style="color:#8A8A8A">Sundays with Anna</div><h1 class="hd" style="margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:84px;line-height:.95">Say hi</h1><div class="hand" style="font-size:34px;transform:rotate(-2deg)">I read every message</div></section>
<section class="p" style="padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px"><div class="art-body" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
<p>The easiest way to reach me is a direct message on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sundayswithanna/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@sundayswithanna</a>.</p>
<h2>What I can help with</h2>
<ul class="chk">
<li>Questions about a review or a routine.</li>
<li>Corrections, if you spot something wrong in a note.</li>
<li>Privacy requests, such as deleting your information.</li>
<li>Brand and partnership enquiries: please mention your brand and what you have in mind.</li>
</ul>
<h2>A quick note</h2>
<p>I am not a medical professional, so I cannot give medical advice or diagnose skin or health problems. For those, please see a doctor or dermatologist.</p>
</div></section>
</Base>
